            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This interactive feature presents the case of a 40-year-old woman with pain, weakness, and poor oral intake. She had had a gradual onset of bilateral flank pain spreading to her lower back, abdomen, and extremities. Test your diagnostic and therapeutic skills at NEJM.org.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
